CallRec\":\"Add\",\"thesisHealth\":\"Strengthening\",\"recommendedSize\":42,\"tier\":\"established\",\"trajectory\":\"softening\",\"finalAction\":\"Add\",\"trendRationale\":\"This quarter showed a single soft signal (the analyst lowered recommended size by 3+ percentage points) but the prior quarter was clean. One isolated quarter of softness isn't enough to act on — could just be the analyst tuning position size on a strong call. The trend layer flags it to monitor; if next quarter also comes in soft, the two-soft rule will kick in and we'll consider stepping the recommendation down.\"},{\"analysisId\":269,\"transcriptId\":160,\"callDate\":\"2021-07-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"title\":\"Apple (AAPL) Q3 2021 Earnings Call Transcript\",\"tickerId\":43,\"symbol\":\"AAPL\",\"shortName\":\"Apple\",\"tickerStatus\":\"portfolio\",\"perCallRec\":\"Add\",\"thesisHealth\":\"Strengthening\",\"recommendedSize\":55,\"tier\":\"established\",\"trajectory\":\"improving\",\"finalAction\":\"Add\",\"trendRationale\":\"The analyst stepped conviction up this quarter (higher recommended size, fresh-money gap not widening, no credibility or mitigation concerns). On an established ticker we wait for a second confirming quarter before stepping the recommendation up — one strong quarter on a mature name can be noise. Watch this; if next quarter also comes in improving, the trend layer will upgrade.\"},{\"analysisId\":318,\"transcriptId\":209,\"callDate\":\"2021-07-27T00:00:00.000Z\",\"title\":\"Microsoft (MSFT) Q4 2021 Earnings Call Transcript\",\"tickerId\":82,\"symbol\":\"MSFT\",\"shortName\":\"Microsoft\",\"tickerStatus\":\"portfolio\",\"perCallRec\":\"Add\",\"thesisHealth\":\"Strengthening\",\"recommendedSize\":55,\"tier\":\"established\",\"trajectory\":\"softening\",\"finalAction\":\"Add\",\"trendRationale\":\"This quarter showed a single soft signal (the gap between recommended size and fresh-money allocation widened by 2+ points (analyst getting more cautious about new buying)) but the prio